(5731539, 833470, 56579, '<td valign="top">Too noisy for my taste, it distracts from the image.  Further more such a simple part shows no connection to any interesting subject.  But at the same time it is not simple enough to be abstract.  If it was less noisy and sharper it could possibly begin to start looking good in an abstract sense, if that is what you were going for.</td>', 'Too noisy for my taste, it distracts from the image.  Further more such a simple part shows no connection to any interesting subject.  But at the same time it is not simple enough to be abstract.  If it was less noisy and sharper it could possibly begin to start looking good in an abstract sense, if that is what you were going for.', '2009-11-18 01:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
