(5732342, 833819, 83313, '<td valign="top">I suspect you may be getting some comments of "distracting elements" regarding the background. However, this is clearly street photography and such things are outside the control of the photographer. You did the best possible with that aspect, and captured a unique moment that looks slightly out of place on a busy city street.</td>', 'I suspect you may be getting some comments of "distracting elements" regarding the background. However, this is clearly street photography and such things are outside the control of the photographer. You did the best possible with that aspect, and captured a unique moment that looks slightly out of place on a busy city street.', '2009-11-18 13:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
