(5733625, 834230, 83313, '<td valign="top">It''s certainly debatable, but I would actually consider this to be rule of thirds composition, as my  gaze is led up to her eyes, which are in a ROT area. I''m not dinging my vote however, as these composition rules are very subject to personal interpretation Very cute pic, regardless.</td>', 'It''s certainly debatable, but I would actually consider this to be rule of thirds composition, as my  gaze is led up to her eyes, which are in a ROT area. I''m not dinging my vote however, as these composition rules are very subject to personal interpretation Very cute pic, regardless.', '2009-11-19 13:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
