(5733630, 833690, 83313, '<td valign="top">It''s very grainy, unfortunately, and that really hurts it. An extra point for honesty in your title, however.</td>', 'It''s very grainy, unfortunately, and that really hurts it. An extra point for honesty in your title, however.', '2009-11-19 13:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5733632, 833946, 83313, '<td valign="top">My eye is led to the man with the glasses, which seems more of a rule of thirds to me, however, these compositional rules are very open to interpretation and I think you were centering it around the fingertip. I really like this, however. It''s different and has a lot of visual impact.</td>', 'My eye is led to the man with the glasses, which seems more of a rule of thirds to me, however, these compositional rules are very open to interpretation and I think you were centering it around the fingertip. I really like this, however. It''s different and has a lot of visual impact.', '2009-11-19 13:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5733635, 834145, 83313, '<td valign="top">Kind of soft, and I find the yellow cast a bit too strong for my taste. I would have cut down the saturation on the yellow channel a bit, so that the feathers on the bird were more white looking.</td>', 'Kind of soft, and I find the yellow cast a bit too strong for my taste. I would have cut down the saturation on the yellow channel a bit, so that the feathers on the bird were more white looking.', '2009-11-19 13:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5733638, 834178, 83313, '<td valign="top">If this is not an <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=52549" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">IreneM</a> entry, it is from someone who is seriously challenging her. Excellent work to get this so smooth, crisp and perfect under basic editing rules. Hate to always give such high votes to themes that have become DPC cliche shots, but good is good. Well done.</td>', 'If this is not an  IreneM entry, it is from someone who is seriously challenging her. Excellent work to get this so smooth, crisp and perfect under basic editing rules. Hate to always give such high votes to themes that have become DPC cliche shots, but good is good. Well done.', '2009-11-19 13:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5733639, 834113, 83313, '<td valign="top">Does not work for me I''m afraid. Seems soft with a heavy color cast. Not sure the centered comp is doing anything to enhance the scene, either. Sorry to have to low vote this, because I do perceive some effort in this.</td>', 'Does not work for me I''m afraid. Seems soft with a heavy color cast. Not sure the centered comp is doing anything to enhance the scene, either. Sorry to have to low vote this, because I do perceive some effort in this.', '2009-11-19 13:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
