(5733836, 834284, 42256, '<td valign="top">This is great, I think the angle really works well.. nice timing! 8</td>', 'This is great, I think the angle really works well.. nice timing! 8', '2009-11-19 16:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5733837, 834203, 42256, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful, clouds are just amazing.. nice control of light!! Bumped it to 8</td>', 'This is beautiful, clouds are just amazing.. nice control of light!! Bumped it to 8', '2009-11-19 16:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5733840, 834246, 45631, '<td valign="top">Everyone''s interpretation of a ''centered composition'' will vary.  For me this image doesn''t work for the subject.  Yes, it sort of is centered but then again it''s not.  Maybe is you had given it more of a wide angle view with more room around the items to really put them in a centered position it would have worked better.  The glasses are also not very interesting.  They don''t draw me in and make me want to look at at the image for any length of time.</td>', 'Everyone''s interpretation of a ''centered composition'' will vary.  For me this image doesn''t work for the subject.  Yes, it sort of is centered but then again it''s not.  Maybe is you had given it more of a wide angle view with more room around the items to really put them in a centered position it would have worked better.  The glasses are also not very interesting.  They don''t draw me in and make me want to look at at the image for any length of time.', '2009-11-19 16:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5733843, 833474, 42256, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light captured in the picture and really nice composition.  Only 2 things bad about this is the distracting pole and sign post in the far back! Those nature killers :) 8</td>', 'Beautiful light captured in the picture and really nice composition.  Only 2 things bad about this is the distracting pole and sign post in the far back! Those nature killers :) 8', '2009-11-19 16:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5733846, 833537, 42256, '<td valign="top">Far up north where I live these are hard to find in this season, its a welcome sight! Beautifully captured.. a little more depth with the front petals being in focused would have really made it outstanding, but still a great shot! 8</td>', 'Far up north where I live these are hard to find in this season, its a welcome sight! Beautifully captured.. a little more depth with the front petals being in focused would have really made it outstanding, but still a great shot! 8', '2009-11-19 16:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5733847, 833690, 45631, '<td valign="top">Whilst one rose is in the centre the others are not, therefore not fitting the subject IMO  None of the flowers are in focus, yes the centre one a bit more but really not enough to draw my eye to it as the subject matter.  The white in the back is also very distracting.  Work on your composition and removing distracting elements from your images.</td>', 'Whilst one rose is in the centre the others are not, therefore not fitting the subject IMO  None of the flowers are in focus, yes the centre one a bit more but really not enough to draw my eye to it as the subject matter.  The white in the back is also very distracting.  Work on your composition and removing distracting elements from your images.', '2009-11-19 16:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5733850, 834128, 45631, '<td valign="top">yes, a centered composition but the subject isn''t very interesting.</td>', 'yes, a centered composition but the subject isn''t very interesting.', '2009-11-19 16:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5733851, 834202, 42256, '<td valign="top">Great lighting! Those catch light in the eyes are really well done! Messy hair on the top and loss of definition near the feather end is distracting and without that I would have given it a point or two more(coming from a person who cannot even achieve a lighting result like this) .. 8</td>', 'Great lighting! Those catch light in the eyes are really well done! Messy hair on the top and loss of definition near the feather end is distracting and without that I would have given it a point or two more(coming from a person who cannot even achieve a lighting result like this) .. 8', '2009-11-19 16:32:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5733852, 834229, 45631, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t jump out at me as a ''centred'' composition and I want something shot for this challenge to do exactly that.  The subject is dark and the background lighting is to strong at the top.  Sorry, it just doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'This doesn''t jump out at me as a ''centred'' composition and I want something shot for this challenge to do exactly that.  The subject is dark and the background lighting is to strong at the top.  Sorry, it just doesn''t work for me.', '2009-11-19 16:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
