(5733859, 833968, 45631, '<td valign="top">The image lacks sharpness for an insect shot and it doesn''t hold my interest.  Whist the image is centered it''s not the type image that shows that some thought was put into the subject matter and meeting the challenge creatively.</td>', 'The image lacks sharpness for an insect shot and it doesn''t hold my interest.  Whist the image is centered it''s not the type image that shows that some thought was put into the subject matter and meeting the challenge creatively.', '2009-11-19 16:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5733861, 834210, 42256, '<td valign="top">Beautiful catch light and great control of light with the second eye still showing up a little.  Beautiful model! I gave it a 8 and the only reason why not a 10 is because when I reduced my browser window size to crop it further (to visualize) so that I am not seeing any background or the hand I like it better - my 2 cents!</td>', 'Beautiful catch light and great control of light with the second eye still showing up a little.  Beautiful model! I gave it a 8 and the only reason why not a 10 is because when I reduced my browser window size to crop it further (to visualize) so that I am not seeing any background or the hand I like it better - my 2 cents!', '2009-11-19 16:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5733862, 834237, 45631, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t jump out at me as a ''centred'' composition and I want something shot for this challenge to do that.  The bud that should be drawing my attention is not in focus, the one at the back is.  The subject isn''t really of much interest either, sorry.  Work on selecting interesting subject material, focus and composition.</td>', 'This doesn''t jump out at me as a ''centred'' composition and I want something shot for this challenge to do that.  The bud that should be drawing my attention is not in focus, the one at the back is.  The subject isn''t really of much interest either, sorry.  Work on selecting interesting subject material, focus and composition.', '2009-11-19 16:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
