(5733867, 834088, 42256, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot, I love the use of natural light.  Texture on the windows is amazing! 7<br/> <br/>Reason why I didn''t vote this higher : This needs to be straightened just a tad bit.. it would help the shot a lot! Also while this is probably not posed, a beautiful model at the same location would have made this shot a definite 10!</td>', 'This is a great shot, I love the use of natural light.  Texture on the windows is amazing! 7 Reason why I didn''t vote this higher : This needs to be straightened just a tad bit.. it would help the shot a lot! Also while this is probably not posed, a beautiful model at the same location would have made this shot a definite 10!', '2009-11-19 16:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5733869, 833987, 108580, '<td valign="top">The lighting on this is so good, the shadow and colour detail so perfect, the title simple yet accurate. That hand in the background  behind the softbox (I think) can only belong to one person. You (two?) never cease to amaze me with your technicals...I can see that you''re not drug users or had medical experience :) You should have flicked the air bubbles out of the syringe :) and perhaps had everything a little bit higher for Centred Comp IV. Only faults I can see 10-1=9</td>', 'The lighting on this is so good, the shadow and colour detail so perfect, the title simple yet accurate. That hand in the background  behind the softbox (I think) can only belong to one person. You (two?) never cease to amaze me with your technicals...I can see that you''re not drug users or had medical experience :) You should have flicked the air bubbles out of the syringe :) and perhaps had everything a little bit higher for Centred Comp IV. Only faults I can see 10-1=9', '2009-11-19 16:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5733873, 833335, 45631, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t work well for me as a centered composition.  If you want to use a portrait for this type of challenge is needs to be shot wide open to remove the distracting background and have flattering lighting.  This comes across as a snapshot with with harsh lighting.</td>', 'This doesn''t work well for me as a centered composition.  If you want to use a portrait for this type of challenge is needs to be shot wide open to remove the distracting background and have flattering lighting.  This comes across as a snapshot with with harsh lighting.', '2009-11-19 16:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5733875, 833394, 91915, '<td valign="top">Nice soft portrait. Great shallow depth of field to get the sharpness in the eyes and the softness elsewhere.</td>', 'Nice soft portrait. Great shallow depth of field to get the sharpness in the eyes and the softness elsewhere.', '2009-11-19 16:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
