(5733878, 833253, 45631, '<td valign="top">Photos of statues don''t really work for me.  The subject of the image is centred but the whole background is in focus.  The background is not an asset to this image so you need to use a larger aperture to bring the focus back to the statue.</td>', 'Photos of statues don''t really work for me.  The subject of the image is centred but the whole background is in focus.  The background is not an asset to this image so you need to use a larger aperture to bring the focus back to the statue.', '2009-11-19 16:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
