(5733926, 833712, 45631, '<td valign="top">Centered composition - yes.  Image interest - weak.  A nice sharp shot but the subject is not very interesting.  The two glasses at the front a distracting in this composition.</td>', 'Centered composition - yes.  Image interest - weak.  A nice sharp shot but the subject is not very interesting.  The two glasses at the front a distracting in this composition.', '2009-11-19 17:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5733927, 833345, 91915, '<td valign="top">Nice job. I like it.<br/>I think the depth of field is a bit too shallow. I see that you''re probably going for that effect, but I would have preferred just a little more.</td>', 'Nice job. I like it.I think the depth of field is a bit too shallow. I see that you''re probably going for that effect, but I would have preferred just a little more.', '2009-11-19 17:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5733929, 834157, 45631, '<td valign="top">This image just doesn''t meet the challenge for me, it''s just color and blur.</td>', 'This image just doesn''t meet the challenge for me, it''s just color and blur.', '2009-11-19 17:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5733930, 833611, 45631, '<td valign="top">Centered composition - yes.  Subject interest - weak.  Very dark image and the subject just doesn''t hold much interest, more lighting may have helped.</td>', 'Centered composition - yes.  Subject interest - weak.  Very dark image and the subject just doesn''t hold much interest, more lighting may have helped.', '2009-11-19 17:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5733931, 833746, 92577, '<td valign="top">terrific exposure</td>', 'terrific exposure', '2009-11-19 17:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5733933, 834146, 91915, '<td valign="top">Nice effect!</td>', 'Nice effect!', '2009-11-19 17:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5733934, 834269, 45631, '<td valign="top">Centered composition - yes.  Subject interest - weak.  This image holds no interest to a viewer.  Work on creating images that draws a viewers attention.</td>', 'Centered composition - yes.  Subject interest - weak.  This image holds no interest to a viewer.  Work on creating images that draws a viewers attention.', '2009-11-19 17:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5733935, 833790, 45631, '<td valign="top">Centered composition - yes,  Subject interest - weak.  This type of image needs sharpness and detail to make it interesting and both are lacking here.</td>', 'Centered composition - yes,  Subject interest - weak.  This type of image needs sharpness and detail to make it interesting and both are lacking here.', '2009-11-19 17:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5733936, 833942, 45631, '<td valign="top">Centered composition - yes.  Subject interest - medium.  Lighting is a bit harsh for this, use a diffuser when shoot flowers on a sunny day and it will improve the quality of the shot with a more diffused lighting.  A little more saturation and sharpness would have helped this image also.</td>', 'Centered composition - yes.  Subject interest - medium.  Lighting is a bit harsh for this, use a diffuser when shoot flowers on a sunny day and it will improve the quality of the shot with a more diffused lighting.  A little more saturation and sharpness would have helped this image also.', '2009-11-19 17:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5733938, 833345, 45631, '<td valign="top">Centered composition - yes.  Subject interest - The shallow DOF hasn''t work well on this subject for me.</td>', 'Centered composition - yes.  Subject interest - The shallow DOF hasn''t work well on this subject for me.', '2009-11-19 17:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5733942, 834062, 45631, '<td valign="top">Centered composition - yes.  Subject interest - weak.  Technicals - too many distracting elements in this shot.  Work on subject matter, composition and DOF.</td>', 'Centered composition - yes.  Subject interest - weak.  Technicals - too many distracting elements in this shot.  Work on subject matter, composition and DOF.', '2009-11-19 17:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5733947, 834248, 45631, '<td valign="top">Centered composition - yes.  Subject interest - weak.  Needs better lighting on the subject and composition isn''t very strong, feet are cut off and the change between concrete and grass is strong.</td>', 'Centered composition - yes.  Subject interest - weak.  Needs better lighting on the subject and composition isn''t very strong, feet are cut off and the change between concrete and grass is strong.', '2009-11-19 17:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5733951, 834216, 45631, '<td valign="top">Centered composition - yes.  Subject interest - uninteresting.  Boarder - distracting color.  Work on subject material and composition.  When using a boarder it should flatter the image.</td>', 'Centered composition - yes.  Subject interest - uninteresting.  Boarder - distracting color.  Work on subject material and composition.  When using a boarder it should flatter the image.', '2009-11-19 17:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5733954, 833293, 45631, '<td valign="top">Centered composition - yes.  Subject interest - weak.  The composition for the shot of this rose is uninteresting.  The image is messy with twigs and leaves drawing attention.  Work on these errors for your next entry.</td>', 'Centered composition - yes.  Subject interest - weak.  The composition for the shot of this rose is uninteresting.  The image is messy with twigs and leaves drawing attention.  Work on these errors for your next entry.', '2009-11-19 17:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5733960, 833997, 45631, '<td valign="top">Centered composition - not what I''m looking for in this challenge.  Harsh lighting, distracting background elements, weak subject.  Work on these for your next entry.  Try to make your image look more than just a snapshot.</td>', 'Centered composition - not what I''m looking for in this challenge.  Harsh lighting, distracting background elements, weak subject.  Work on these for your next entry.  Try to make your image look more than just a snapshot.', '2009-11-19 17:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5733961, 834046, 45631, '<td valign="top">I don''t see this as a centered composition.  It more a fill the frame as that is what the subject has done.  Nothing to focus on in the middle.</td>', 'I don''t see this as a centered composition.  It more a fill the frame as that is what the subject has done.  Nothing to focus on in the middle.', '2009-11-19 17:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
