(5733994, 833495, 45631, '<td valign="top">Centered composition - yes, but not what I''m really looking for in this type of challenge.  Background on this image is a bit blown out and a portrait shot of the back of a head doesn''t hold interest as a subject.  Sorry</td>', 'Centered composition - yes, but not what I''m really looking for in this type of challenge.  Background on this image is a bit blown out and a portrait shot of the back of a head doesn''t hold interest as a subject.  Sorry', '2009-11-19 17:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5733996, 834162, 45631, '<td valign="top">Centered composition - yes.  Sharpness - the rosebud lacks the sharpness required to draw me to it.  Focus seems to be behind the subject a bit.  This image could be improved by using a shallower DOF to make the bud pop and the greens behind merge.</td>', 'Centered composition - yes.  Sharpness - the rosebud lacks the sharpness required to draw me to it.  Focus seems to be behind the subject a bit.  This image could be improved by using a shallower DOF to make the bud pop and the greens behind merge.', '2009-11-19 17:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5733997, 834027, 51538, '<td valign="top">Beautiful detail and a generous sized image too. 10.</td>', 'Beautiful detail and a generous sized image too. 10.', '2009-11-19 17:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
