(5734387, 833794, 42256, '<td valign="top">Its beautiful capture, great timing and I know they are difficult to catch in time must have taken a few shots to get this right! Great effort! <br/> <br/>Only negative is while the shot is great to make it a 10 at DPC I have started expecting spot on focus, from head to tail, wings frozen and both of them visible - I know it is hard to get that, I can never get it (hence the lack of ribbons in my profile) - 7</td>', 'Its beautiful capture, great timing and I know they are difficult to catch in time must have taken a few shots to get this right! Great effort!  Only negative is while the shot is great to make it a 10 at DPC I have started expecting spot on focus, from head to tail, wings frozen and both of them visible - I know it is hard to get that, I can never get it (hence the lack of ribbons in my profile) - 7', '2009-11-19 22:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5734393, 834060, 42256, '<td valign="top">Centered composition really works well with this shot! Seeing 2 beautiful sights at the same time is amazing!  <br/> <br/> gave it a 7 because I feel there is something missing in the shot, I can''t put my finger on exactly what.  Maybe its the shallow DOF or the lack of it, or the lack of focus / details of hair.</td>', 'Centered composition really works well with this shot! Seeing 2 beautiful sights at the same time is amazing!    gave it a 7 because I feel there is something missing in the shot, I can''t put my finger on exactly what.  Maybe its the shallow DOF or the lack of it, or the lack of focus / details of hair.', '2009-11-19 22:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5734394, 833987, 42256, '<td valign="top">I want that syringe for the next challenge :)<br/>This is a great composition and DOF is just perfect, I had it at 7, bumping it to 8</td>', 'I want that syringe for the next challenge :)This is a great composition and DOF is just perfect, I had it at 7, bumping it to 8', '2009-11-19 22:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
