(5734831, 834184, 105457, '<td valign="top">I like the texture in the back very much. The image suffered a bit from resizing, unfortunately.</td>', 'I like the texture in the back very much. The image suffered a bit from resizing, unfortunately.', '2009-11-20 11:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
