(5734846, 833286, 105457, '<td valign="top">You got a bit of noise going on there. It''s a little underexposed, was a flash used?</td>', 'You got a bit of noise going on there. It''s a little underexposed, was a flash used?', '2009-11-20 11:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
