(5735751, 833450, 102278, '<td valign="top">Fantastic animal portrait. Wonderful technical attributes. 8.</td>', 'Fantastic animal portrait. Wonderful technical attributes. 8.', '2009-11-21 10:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5735758, 833470, 102278, '<td valign="top">I love the grain with this and the abstract feel. Wonderful. 8.</td>', 'I love the grain with this and the abstract feel. Wonderful. 8.', '2009-11-21 10:37:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5735760, 833875, 102278, '<td valign="top">Good concept. 5.</td>', 'Good concept. 5.', '2009-11-21 10:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5735773, 833293, 102278, '<td valign="top">I feel that the angle of the composition is not getting the most out of the subject. The bottom of the rose is very dark. Maybe a shot with the light of the top of the rose would have helped. Also, the leaves at the top of the shot are pretty distracting. Experiment with a few different angles would have produced a more interesting shot i feel. 4.</td>', 'I feel that the angle of the composition is not getting the most out of the subject. The bottom of the rose is very dark. Maybe a shot with the light of the top of the rose would have helped. Also, the leaves at the top of the shot are pretty distracting. Experiment with a few different angles would have produced a more interesting shot i feel. 4.', '2009-11-21 10:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5735777, 833690, 102278, '<td valign="top">I find the two blurred roses to the left and right a bit of a distraction here. Perhaps a shot of just the single rose would have been more interesting. Also, i''m not a great fan of the grain here. It doesn''t really help the subject i feel. 4.</td>', 'I find the two blurred roses to the left and right a bit of a distraction here. Perhaps a shot of just the single rose would have been more interesting. Also, i''m not a great fan of the grain here. It doesn''t really help the subject i feel. 4.', '2009-11-21 11:03:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5735778, 833432, 102278, '<td valign="top">Hum, i think this is a very good shot but it''s not really centered is it. Three steps to your left would have done it. I guess you could say that the subject of the composition is the hand rail that does run down the centre of the shot but then that begs the question, is the handrail really that interesting as to be the subject of the shot? I wouldn''t say so really so i''m giving a relatively low mark. 4.</td>', 'Hum, i think this is a very good shot but it''s not really centered is it. Three steps to your left would have done it. I guess you could say that the subject of the composition is the hand rail that does run down the centre of the shot but then that begs the question, is the handrail really that interesting as to be the subject of the shot? I wouldn''t say so really so i''m giving a relatively low mark. 4.', '2009-11-21 11:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5735802, 834148, 61396, '<td valign="top">You must tell us how you did that (in particular, the part where you convinced George Harrison to join in)</td>', 'You must tell us how you did that (in particular, the part where you convinced George Harrison to join in)', '2009-11-21 11:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5735804, 833484, 102278, '<td valign="top">It''s a centered composition but i feel not a very interesting shot to be honest. Perhaps a different angle may give the image more impact? 4.</td>', 'It''s a centered composition but i feel not a very interesting shot to be honest. Perhaps a different angle may give the image more impact? 4.', '2009-11-21 11:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5735805, 833676, 102278, '<td valign="top">A bit washed out i feel. Perhaps more contract may give the image more impact. 4.</td>', 'A bit washed out i feel. Perhaps more contract may give the image more impact. 4.', '2009-11-21 11:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5735807, 833806, 102278, '<td valign="top">I like the angle of the shot, gives the composition lots of impact. I''m less keen on the processing of the sky though. 5.</td>', 'I like the angle of the shot, gives the composition lots of impact. I''m less keen on the processing of the sky though. 5.', '2009-11-21 11:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5735808, 833830, 102278, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition. 5.</td>', 'Interesting composition. 5.', '2009-11-21 11:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5735810, 833997, 102278, '<td valign="top">Lovely dog. For this challenge i would have prefered the dogs head to be in the centre of the composition though. Also, a bit more contrast may have helped give the image more impact. 4.</td>', 'Lovely dog. For this challenge i would have prefered the dogs head to be in the centre of the composition though. Also, a bit more contrast may have helped give the image more impact. 4.', '2009-11-21 11:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
