(5735834, 834148, 49109, '<td valign="top">this must be <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=74588" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">cutout</a> ''s work. very interesting and meets challenge perfectly. not sure if I still would call this photography if I''d seen it somewhere else, but as the image has been validated it must be<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-11-25 04:08:20.</i></td>', 'this must be  cutout ''s work. very interesting and meets challenge perfectly. not sure if I still would call this photography if I''d seen it somewhere else, but as the image has been validated it must be', '2009-11-21 11:56:20.000000', '2009-11-25 04:08:20.000000', 1),
