(5740896, 833946, 83313, '<td valign="top">You got robbed. One of the more creative and certainly evocative entries in the challenge. . Don''t let the average vote make you think this was not good. It is, it just didn''t hit most voters over the head with wow-factor and it didn''t make them feel good. Sometimes you go in knowing you will have strong appeal for a narrow group.</td>', 'You got robbed. One of the more creative and certainly evocative entries in the challenge. . Don''t let the average vote make you think this was not good. It is, it just didn''t hit most voters over the head with wow-factor and it didn''t make them feel good. Sometimes you go in knowing you will have strong appeal for a narrow group.', '2009-11-25 00:54:30.000000', NULL, 0),
