(5740935, 833146, 67145, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Deen:</b></div><hr/><i> Contratulations!<br/> <br/>Can I ask you a question?<br/> <br/>I notice that you not only take insects photos. Your other type photos are very great, too. But why do you choose the insects photos as challenge entries mostly? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>i''ve been fascinated by insects since i was a small child and i really love photographing them ... also i live in a rural area and during summer there are lots of insects around ..<br/>i have some health problems that stop me getting out as much as i would like so i photograph what i can, which turns out to be insects a lot of the time .. :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-11-25 01:51:16.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by Deen: Contratulations! Can I ask you a question? I notice that you not only take insects photos. Your other type photos are very great, too. But why do you choose the insects photos as challenge entries mostly?   i''ve been fascinated by insects since i was a small child and i really love photographing them ... also i live in a rural area and during summer there are lots of insects around ..i have some health problems that stop me getting out as much as i would like so i photograph what i can, which turns out to be insects a lot of the time .. :)', '2009-11-25 01:40:31.000000', '2009-11-25 01:51:16.000000', 0),
