(5740975, 833146, 69325, '<td valign="top">wow buddy, you''re just going nuts lately! in a good way ;)<br/> <br/>I can remember not that long ago, you saying that you felt you would never connect with the voters or nail down the dpc formula....looks like you were totally wrong. I am proud of you and happy for you and I hope (and think i am right) that photography is a nice distraction from all things physical and personal that ails you.</td>', 'wow buddy, you''re just going nuts lately! in a good way ;) I can remember not that long ago, you saying that you felt you would never connect with the voters or nail down the dpc formula....looks like you were totally wrong. I am proud of you and happy for you and I hope (and think i am right) that photography is a nice distraction from all things physical and personal that ails you.', '2009-11-25 02:22:47.000000', NULL, 0),
