(5742220, 833781, 67145, '<td valign="top">i had a look thru the challenge during voting .. i remember this one coz i was going to make comment .. <br/>i was thinking it was you at the time, but not totally sure .. i loved the particularly intense stare, the unshaved face and the b&amp;w treatment .. they say you cant judge a book by its cover, but a lot of the time when you see a person''s face you get an idea of what''s inside .. if that''s the case with you then you''re incredibly wise, intuitive, perceptive and deep .. you poor buggar .. lol .. !!<br/>anyhooooo .. congrats on 8th, its a brilliant shot .. sorry the fly beat you .. in a perfect world we would''v shared the red .. !!! .. you for something that has depth and meaning and me for an insect whose details most ppl dont see .. they might be grateful for that tho .. !!<br/>hope life is good for you and your family .. :)</td>', 'i had a look thru the challenge during voting .. i remember this one coz i was going to make comment .. i was thinking it was you at the time, but not totally sure .. i loved the particularly intense stare, the unshaved face and the b&w treatment .. they say you cant judge a book by its cover, but a lot of the time when you see a person''s face you get an idea of what''s inside .. if that''s the case with you then you''re incredibly wise, intuitive, perceptive and deep .. you poor buggar .. lol .. !!anyhooooo .. congrats on 8th, its a brilliant shot .. sorry the fly beat you .. in a perfect world we would''v shared the red .. !!! .. you for something that has depth and meaning and me for an insect whose details most ppl dont see .. they might be grateful for that tho .. !!hope life is good for you and your family .. :)', '2009-11-25 20:59:19.000000', NULL, 0),
