(5744150, 833791, 30861, '<td valign="top">Hey, Brad? Which way is this beast pointed? It looks like he''s pointed to the right, but then his nostrils are behind his eyes? LOL.<br/> <br/>Killer shot BTW, congrats on blue.</td>', 'Hey, Brad? Which way is this beast pointed? It looks like he''s pointed to the right, but then his nostrils are behind his eyes? LOL. Killer shot BTW, congrats on blue.', '2009-11-27 19:05:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(5744192, 833791, 37845, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Bear_Music:</b></div><hr/><i> Hey, Brad? Which way is this beast pointed? It looks like he''s pointed to the right, but then his nostrils are behind his eyes? LOL.<br/> <br/>Killer shot BTW, congrats on blue. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Hey Bear<br/> <br/>The croc is pointed with its mouth to the right, and the body to the left. The slits behind the eyes are actually the ears. If you look at the other pic posted in the description, you will see more of the face, with the nostrils as well. <br/> <br/>Thanks for the kind words :)<br/> <br/>Brad</td>', 'Originally posted by Bear_Music: Hey, Brad? Which way is this beast pointed? It looks like he''s pointed to the right, but then his nostrils are behind his eyes? LOL. Killer shot BTW, congrats on blue.   Hey Bear The croc is pointed with its mouth to the right, and the body to the left. The slits behind the eyes are actually the ears. If you look at the other pic posted in the description, you will see more of the face, with the nostrils as well.  Thanks for the kind words :) Brad', '2009-11-27 19:56:55.000000', NULL, 0),
