(5744279, 834088, 99710, '<td valign="top">This photo scored unbelievably low. I honestly thought this would place quite high.</td>', 'This photo scored unbelievably low. I honestly thought this would place quite high.', '2009-11-27 23:03:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(5744406, 833484, 85849, '<td valign="top">I did another one of my famous take a shot and make it fit the challenge and this time I paid the price.<br/> <br/>The original shot wasn''t centered, so I had to change the crop. When I cropped it more to lose the chin, it seemed more difficult to tell that it was a jacket. I really should stick to submitting photos that are taken with the challenge in mind.<br/> <br/>I''m thankful to those who voted higher, but I do agree that it wasn''t my best.</td>', 'I did another one of my famous take a shot and make it fit the challenge and this time I paid the price. The original shot wasn''t centered, so I had to change the crop. When I cropped it more to lose the chin, it seemed more difficult to tell that it was a jacket. I really should stick to submitting photos that are taken with the challenge in mind. I''m thankful to those who voted higher, but I do agree that it wasn''t my best.', '2009-11-28 01:26:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(5744412, 833781, 85849, '<td valign="top">Way to go on the top 10!<br/> <br/>I didn''t even bother voting (don''t tell anyone) so I didn''t see this until now.<br/> <br/>What an intense look. Was one of the kids acting up that day? It reminds me of the shot of Lou. I''d say you guys share the same geen pool, if I didn''t know you were family by marriage ;)<br/> <br/>The BW, DOF, contrast and sharpness are perfect!</td>', 'Way to go on the top 10! I didn''t even bother voting (don''t tell anyone) so I didn''t see this until now. What an intense look. Was one of the kids acting up that day? It reminds me of the shot of Lou. I''d say you guys share the same geen pool, if I didn''t know you were family by marriage ;) The BW, DOF, contrast and sharpness are perfect!', '2009-11-28 01:35:50.000000', NULL, 0),
